[gd_scene load_steps=39 format=3]

; Act 1 -- the powerhouse.
;
; Five spaces on the 0.5 m grid, built by src/world/kit/ from their dimensions
; rather than from several hundred hand-placed boxes. Derived from
; docs/STORY.md ("The place") and docs/PUZZLES.md (Act 1).
;
; Where two rooms share a wall, only one of them builds it -- otherwise the
; surfaces are coplanar, fight, and cost twice the geometry for the privilege.
; The room whose doorway it is keeps it.
;
; Every lamp starts dark. Emergency lighting is P1.1, the first puzzle in the
; game, and the flashlight is the only light until it is solved.

